data.code:
Input : MK (the variable-length shared secret)
        I  (the input block of the pseudorandom function)
        MKlen (length of MK in octets)
        len (length of the message in octets)
Output: TK (the Traffic_Key, 128 bits)

Step 1.  If MKlen == 16:
           K := MK;
         else:
           K := AES-CMAC(0^128, MK, MKlen);
Step 2.  TK := AES-CMAC(K, I, len);
         return TK;
